{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The <strong>Crucible</strong> must be completed! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first of many Crucibles have been built, and now you must defend it! Not long after the operation began, portals started appearing. Beyond them: waves and waves of different enemies, and their only goal is to conquer what belongs to us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The <strong>Crucible</strong> must be defended!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Operation cannot stop! You need to show them what we are capable of. Use the elements to your advantage, research over 40 different blueprints and build up your defenses! They must be stopped!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The <strong>Crucible</strong> must grow!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We need more resources! Exploit the planet's natural resources, and maintain\u00a0logistical superiority. The weapons need to be maintained, for if they fail, the Operation will be doomed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The <strong>Crucible</strong> must not fall!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation Crucible must succeed. Conquer worlds, build more Crucibles, finish the project!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3629110?t=1757170916","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3629110?t=1757170916","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629110/9085f7d0706622fa0d98fe0b1dd9b956c69e0316/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757170916","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629110/9085f7d0706622fa0d98fe0b1dd9b956c69e0316/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757170916","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The <strong>Crucible</strong> must be completed! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first of many Crucibles have been built, and now you must defend it! Not long after the operation began, portals started appearing. Beyond them: waves and waves of different enemies, and their only goal is to conquer what belongs to us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The <strong>Crucible</strong> must be defended!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Operation cannot stop! You need to show them what we are capable of. Use the elements to your advantage, research over 40 different blueprints and build up your defenses! They must be stopped!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The <strong>Crucible</strong> must grow!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We need more resources! Exploit the planet's natural resources, and maintain\u00a0logistical superiority. The weapons need to be maintained, for if they fail, the Operation will be doomed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The <strong>Crucible</strong> must not fall!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation Crucible must succeed. Conquer worlds, build more Crucibles, finish the project!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Lad\u00e1nyi Bence Vajk","Czegl\u00e9dy D\u00e1niel"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629110/e6caad43eda3cc21107aff46212a77787600